stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Title
    Title --> Setup: Start Game
    Setup --> Playing: Confirm settings
    Playing --> Resolving: Move reaches critical mass
    Playing --> Evaluating: Move without burst
    Resolving --> Resolving: More unstable cells
    Resolving --> Evaluating: Queue empty
    Evaluating --> Finished: Winner determined
    Evaluating --> Playing: Match continues
    Finished --> Setup: New match
